        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The Inclusion and Social Impact Committee of our Board of Directors (“Board”), established over 20 years ago, assists the Board in providing oversight of the Company’s strategy and efforts to advance the Company’s business through the Company’s culture and core values, including creating access to opportunity for its various stakeholders and supporting the communities in which the Company operates.",
